This product includes software developed by IMG-LTD.

MMPay uses the following open source framework foundations:

- Pig, a Spring Cloud Alibaba based backend scaffold from
  https://gitee.com/log4j/pig. MMPay uses the Spring Cloud Alibaba foundation
  and keeps unrelated Pig modules disabled in this repository.
- soybean-admin, a Vue 3 admin frontend template from
  https://github.com/soybeanjs/soybean-admin. MMPay uses the Vue, Vite, Pinia,
  and Naive UI stack for the admin console baseline.
- dg-payment-skills, a Huifu payment integration skill package from
  https://github.com/huifurepo/dg-payment-skills. Its repository declares
  CC BY-NC 4.0 and Huifu-owned technical content. MMPay treats it as
  review-only guidance and does not compile, vendor, redistribute, or ship its
  content as part of this repository.

Provider credentials, merchant private keys, webhook secrets, and license
signing keys are not included in this repository.
